claim.claim-text:
a lateral flow assay test strip (212);
a capillary tube component (202) configured to provide a metered sample to the lateral flow assay test strip (212);
a depressible air chamber (206) in communication with a sample receiving area (213) and the capillary tube component (202).

a housing comprising a signal window (209) through which is visible at least a portion of the capillary tube component (202);
a transfer button coupled to the compressible chamber (206);
a test results viewing window (211) through which is visible at least a portion of the lateral flow test strip (212).

an assay device (200A, 200B);
a lancet for pricking a finger and providing a blood sample; and
a sample transfer device.
